OL,3,GNEWSAFormer mayor 'truly honoured' by
OL,4,Atown award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Middlesbrough Mayor has been
OL,7,Fawarded one of the town's most
OL,8,Fprestigious honours.
OL,10,FDave Budd, who was the town's elected
OL,11,Fmayor from 2015 to 2019, received the
OL,12,FFreedom of the Borough at a ceremony in
OL,13,Fthe town hall on Thursday.
OL,15,FIn his acceptance speech, Budd said he
OL,16,Fwas "truly honoured" and thanked his
OL,17,Fwife and family for keeping him sane,
OL,18,Fadding: "And sometimes they've
OL,19,Fsucceeded."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
