OL,3,GNEWSAFormer mayor 'truly honoured' by
OL,4,Atown award
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was nominated for his more than 30
OL,7,Fyears in public office and his work to
OL,8,Fdevelop the Tees Heritage Trail, the
OL,9,FMIMA art gallery and for being a
OL,10,F"champion of culture in the town".
